# Eliminate the Impossible: "Creatures your opponents control get -2/-0 until end of turn. If any of them are suspected, they're no longer suspected." Only the opponents' creatures are named.
# Bot1's J. Jonah Jameson suspects itself (an own creature is a legal target of "up to one target creature"); Eliminate the Impossible leaves it suspected and at 2 power, shrinks the opponent's Memnite (1 -> -1) without inventing a suspected state for it, and Bot1 gets its Clue.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
J. Jonah Jameson
Eliminate the Impossible
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.J. Jonah Jameson.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.J. Jonah Jameson)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.J. Jonah Jameson.Suspected = true
Bot1.Hand.Eliminate the Impossible.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.J. Jonah Jameson.Suspected = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.J. Jonah Jameson.Power = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = -1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Suspected = (absent)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Clue Token.Token = True

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Eliminate the Impossible
